-- parity_exempt --
reason: structured-metadata-unobservable
detail: seed populates SeverityText (INFO), which upstream's in-process querier discards before the pipeline runs, so `sum by (category) (count_over_time({job="api"} | json [5m]))` would be answered over different data on the two sides
